{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01476",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.06,
      "end_seconds": 6.83,
      "duration_seconds": 5.77,
      "text": "Doctor, hi, where would you like me to put my coat?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.85,
      "end_seconds": 13.56,
      "duration_seconds": 4.71,
      "text": "You're alright, take a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 14.58,
      "end_seconds": 26.38,
      "duration_seconds": 11.8,
      "text": "Doctor, I've come along because I know the history, if it helps. It's been forgetting recent things, doctor. She didn't want to come, but I insisted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.63,
      "end_seconds": 35.85,
      "duration_seconds": 5.22,
      "text": "Okay, can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.48,
      "end_seconds": 42.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.92,
      "text": "It's lisinopril, 10 milligrams, once a day for my pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 42.99,
      "end_seconds": 51.05,
      "duration_seconds": 8.06,
      "text": "she is supposed to take it once a day, but I can't say she always does"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.41,
      "end_seconds": 62.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.97,
      "text": "sorry, what was I saying, I take glibenclamide, before breakfast"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.89,
      "end_seconds": 65.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "How much do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.03,
      "end_seconds": 71.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "It's 5 milligrams. Aspirin, 75 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.48,
      "end_seconds": 73.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.28,
      "end_seconds": 82.29,
      "duration_seconds": 5.01,
      "text": "Okay, so it's been going on for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.89,
      "end_seconds": 84.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "Anything that improves it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.59,
      "end_seconds": 95.81,
      "duration_seconds": 10.22,
      "text": "hmm, uh, I get some relief from writing notes uh, I've also been misplacing things, for about a year"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.87,
      "end_seconds": 102.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "Have you had any weakness on one side or falls?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.53,
      "end_seconds": 108.17,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "No, no weakness on one side or falls."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.15,
      "end_seconds": 112.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "Any bladder problems, head injury or headache?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.05,
      "end_seconds": 119.5,
      "duration_seconds": 5.45,
      "text": "Let me think, no, no bladder problems, head injury or headache."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.04,
      "end_seconds": 124.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Anything with your heart, like skipped beats or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.21,
      "end_seconds": 128.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "nothing like that that"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.93,
      "end_seconds": 134.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "Has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.02,
      "end_seconds": 138.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "No allergies at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.4,
      "end_seconds": 154.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "what operations have you had, if any?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.95,
      "end_seconds": 162.56,
      "duration_seconds": 5.61,
      "text": "Just two stents put in my heart, three years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.51,
      "end_seconds": 167.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.16,
      "end_seconds": 180.57,
      "duration_seconds": 11.41,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit. I work in accounts at a hospital."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.71,
      "end_seconds": 185.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "What conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.96,
      "end_seconds": 193.7,
      "duration_seconds": 6.74,
      "text": "I, I have high blood pressure, for about ten years. I've had diabetes, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.33,
      "end_seconds": 200.03,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 201.42,
      "end_seconds": 211.69,
      "duration_seconds": 10.27,
      "text": "I have heart disease work has been very busy so I kept ignoring it i'm hoping you can tell me something definite"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.41,
      "end_seconds": 214.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "Right, any other things?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.14,
      "end_seconds": 221.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "Okay, I can see diabetes in your file as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.11,
      "end_seconds": 235.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "I'll note down your vital signs first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.47,
      "end_seconds": 245.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.72,
      "end_seconds": 283.15,
      "duration_seconds": 16.43,
      "text": "Okay: BP is 111 over 81, respiratory rate 15, oxygen saturation is 98 percent. And BMI works out to 23.1, pulse is 78 beats a minute, weight 79 kilos, temp 36.6 degrees, height 185 centimetres."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.08,
      "end_seconds": 287.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "may I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.2,
      "end_seconds": 291.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Take a deep breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 310.5,
      "end_seconds": 318.67,
      "duration_seconds": 8.17,
      "text": "the memory test score is a little low today and the rest of the neurological check is normal"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 323.87,
      "end_seconds": 325.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "All finished, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 344.42,
      "end_seconds": 353.07,
      "duration_seconds": 8.65,
      "text": "Okay, thinking it through, I'd lean towards a gradual memory problem that needs further assessment. I can't rule out depression yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 357.69,
      "end_seconds": 360.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "Is there something to worry about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 362.38,
      "end_seconds": 378.95,
      "duration_seconds": 16.57,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It It looks like a gradual memory problem that needs further assessment, but I'd like to confirm. I think a memory test makes sense here, for memory loss."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 380.98,
      "end_seconds": 382.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "That makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 384.37,
      "end_seconds": 388.94,
      "duration_seconds": 4.57,
      "text": "I'll request a brain scan, it'll help with memory loss."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 390.42,
      "end_seconds": 392.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "When would that take place?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 393.97,
      "end_seconds": 406.65,
      "duration_seconds": 12.68,
      "text": "Keep a daily routine and write things down, a notebook by the door works well. Come back in six weeks. So, have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 407.5,
      "end_seconds": 409.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "alright, thanks, take care"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 411.18,
      "end_seconds": 413.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "So, have a good day."
    }
  ]
}